    <string name="dialog_tips_title">Airport Baggage Tips</string>
    <string name="dialog_tips_message">1. Weigh Luggage at Home:\nWeigh your luggage before leaving for the airport to avoid surprise fees at check-in.\n\n2. Smart Weight Distribution:\nDistribute heavy items between checked luggage and carry-on bags within limits.\n\n3. Pre-Purchase Allowance:\nPurchase extra baggage online ahead of time to get lower rates than airport counter fees.\n\n4. Check Allowance Limits:\nRemember: Economy gives 20 kg free and Business gives 40 kg free allowance.</string>

    <string name="dialog_guide_title">Calculation &amp; Tax Guide</string>
    <string name="dialog_guide_message">1. Free Allowance:\n• Economy Class = 20 kg free allowance\n• Business Class = 40 kg free allowance\n\n2. Excess Weight:\nIf your baggage weighs more than your class allowance, subtract the allowance from your total weight (e.g. 25 kg in Economy = 25 kg - 20 kg = 5 kg excess).\n\n3. Excess Charge:\nMultiply your excess weight (kg) by the rate per kg (RM).\n\n4. Total Payable:\nAdd 8% Service Tax to your excess charge (Charge + 8% Tax).</string>
    <string name="dialog_close">Got It</string>

